help_text:
ℹ️ <b>GIFTPULSE PLATFORMASI HAQIDA</b>

<b>GiftPulse</b> Telegram Collectible Gifts bozori uchun professional monitoring va tahliliy vositadir.

<b>Muhim tushunchalar:</b>
• <b>Collection Floor:</b> Ushbu kolleksiyadagi eng arzon sovg'a narxi;
• <b>Model Floor:</b> Muayyan modelning eng arzon sotuv narxi;
• <b>Rarity (Noyoblik):</b> Rarity ko'rsatkichining foizdagi ifodasi (masalan, 250 permille = 25%);
• <b>GiftPulse Index (GPI):</b> Butun bozor holatini aks ettiruvchi agregat indeks.

Savollar yoki takliflar uchun admin bilan bog'laning.
